  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "WALREIN’s two massively developed tusks can totally shatter blocks of ice weighing ten tons with one blow. This POKéMON’s thick coat of blubber insulates it from subzero temperatures.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "WALREIN swims all over in frigid seawater while crushing icebergs with its grand, imposing tusks. Its thick layer of blubber makes enemy attacks bounce off harmlessly.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "To protect its herd, the leader battles anything that invades its territory, even at the cost of its life. Its tusks may snap off in battle.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It swims through icy seas while shattering ice floes with its large tusks. It is protected by its thick blubber.",
