    {
      "text": "Walrein swims all over in frigid seawater while crushing icebergs with its grand, imposing tusks. Its thick layer of blubber makes enemy attacks bounce off harmlessly.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Walrein form herds of 20 to 30 individuals. When a threat appears, the herd’s leader will protect the group with its life.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Walrein’s tusks keep growing throughout its life. Tusks broken in battle will grow back to their usual impressive size in a year.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its thick tusks are strong enough to shatter drift ice. They have been known to break, but they will grow back by the next year. The Hisui region is well known for these broken tusks.",
